            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daha büyük oyunlar, bir seviyedeki düşmanlar gibi benzer değerleri gruplandırır.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   .gridContainer {&#xA;    display: grid;&#xA;    grid-row-gap: 10px;&#xA;    grid-template-columns: 300px;&#xA;    grid-template-rows: 140px 50px 50px 50px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem {&#xA;    background-color: white;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    padding-top: 5px;&#xA;    padding-left: 10px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.slime {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 3;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.bat {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 3;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 4;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem.goblin {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    grid-column-start: 1;&#xA;    grid-column-end: 2;&#xA;    grid-row-start: 4;&#xA;    grid-row-end: 5;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   body {&#xA;    background-color: #bfdaf9;&#xA;    display: flex;&#xA;    justify-content: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   .gridItem img {&#xA;    float: left;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    width: 30px;&#xA;    margin-right: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   p {&#xA;    margin: 0px;&#xA;    font-size: 25px;&#xA;    padding-top: 7px;&#xA;    color: #3e416d;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerDiv {&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    background-color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #player {&#xA;    height: 137px;&#xA;    width: 137px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #goblinIcon {&#xA;    height: 26px;&#xA;    width: 26px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;gridContainer&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div id=&quot;playerDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/tom.png&quot; id=&quot;player&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem slime&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/elijah.png&quot;&gt;Slime&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem bat&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/portrait-cv.png&quot;&gt;Bat&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;gridItem goblin&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/lee.png&quot; id=&quot;goblinIcon&quot;&gt;Goblin&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her düşman için bir değişken oluşturmak kodunu uzun ve karmaşık hale getirirdi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy3 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>enemy1</code>, ardından <code>enemy2</code> ve son olarak <code>enemy3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her düşman için bir değişken oluşturmak yerine, tüm değerleri <code>[</code> ve <code>]</code> kullanarak bir <strong>dizi</strong> içinde gruplayabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizinin değerlerine <strong>öğe</strong> denir. Örneğin <code>\"Slime\"</code>, <code>\"Bat\"</code> ve <code>\"Goblin\"</code> bu dizinin öğeleridir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Goblin\"</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147881,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Boş bir dizi oluşturmak için <code>[</code> ve <code>]</code> kodlarını yazarız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147882,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Köşeli parantezlerin arasına bir dize yerleştirmek, tek bir değere sahip bir dizi oluşturur; bunu <code>\"Slime\"</code> ile dene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"24\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Slime\"</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147883,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizideki iki veya daha fazla değeri, <code>\"Slime\"</code> ile <code>\"Bat\"</code> örneğinde olduğu gibi, birbirinden ayırmak için virgülleri <code>,</code> kullanırız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>,</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
