            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziye istediğin sayıda değer sığar. Virgül ve ardından değeri yazarak daha fazlasını ekleriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"41\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>,</code>, ardından <code>\"Goblin\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
