            "id": 147893,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"Player1\"</code> değerine sahip bir dizi depolayan <code>activePlayers</code> değişkenini oluştur.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Player2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activePlayers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Active:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activePlayers);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>activePlayers</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>\"Player1\"</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
